{"id":"613624","name":"菠菜鲜贝馅饼","author":"不做妖精好多年","authorId":"1806550","desc":"*本菜谱为作者独家发布于美食天下，禁止其他平台或个人转载。","cover":"images/613624/cover.jpg","ingredients":{"main":[{"name":"面团","amount":"50g"},{"name":"菠菜","amount":"几棵"},{"name":"鲜贝","amount":"60g"}],"sub":[{"name":"猪肉糜","amount":"小许"},{"name":"胡萝卜","amount":"小许"}]},"steps":[{"step":1,"desc":"菠菜洗净，胡萝卜切丝。","img":"images/613624/step_1.jpg"},{"step":2,"desc":"锅烧开水，放蔬菜焯水。","img":"images/613624/step_2.jpg"},{"step":3,"desc":"过冷水。","img":"images/613624/step_3.jpg"},{"step":4,"desc":"撰干水分，切末。","img":"images/613624/step_4.jpg"},{"step":5,"desc":"取鲜贝肉和肉糜。","img":"images/613624/step_5.jpg"},{"step":6,"desc":"改刀，切葱末。","img":"images/613624/step_6.jpg"},{"step":7,"desc":"放碗里。","img":"images/613624/step_7.jpg"},{"step":8,"desc":"放菠菜。","img":"images/613624/step_8.jpg"},{"step":9,"desc":"放食用油。","img":"images/613624/step_9.jpg"},{"step":10,"desc":"放食盐和鸡精。","img":"images/613624/step_10.jpg"},{"step":11,"desc":"放生抽。","img":"images/613624/step_11.jpg"},{"step":12,"desc":"拌匀。","img":"images/613624/step_12.jpg"},{"step":13,"desc":"取面团。","img":"images/613624/step_13.jpg"},{"step":14,"desc":"擀皮。","img":"images/613624/step_14.jpg"},{"step":15,"desc":"放馅料。","img":"images/613624/step_15.jpg"},{"step":16,"desc":"包成馅饼。","img":"images/613624/step_16.jpg"},{"step":17,"desc":"或烧热，放馅饼。","img":"images/613624/step_17.jpg"},{"step":18,"desc":"一面金黄翻面。","img":"images/613624/step_18.jpg"},{"step":19,"desc":"另一面也金黄，继续翻面，反复2次即可。","img":"images/613624/step_19.jpg"},{"step":20,"desc":"取出来。","img":"images/613624/step_20.jpg"},{"step":21,"desc":"切块。","img":"images/613624/step_21.jpg"},{"step":22,"desc":"摆盘。","img":"images/613624/step_22.jpg"},{"step":23,"desc":"成品。","img":"images/613624/step_23.jpg"}],"tips":"来自 美食天下  的作品\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t使用的厨具：不粘锅\n\t\t\t\t\n\t\t\t\t\t所属分类：","attrs":{}}